+# Proposed additive integration: complete benzel residue-zero construction
+
+This is a **local integration description**, not a created remote PR.
+
+Last recorded mathematical repository base: `KokunoYumeto/mathematics-commons-pilot@20cb022dcfda7f37b3adec13b5619be8f13be3e8`. Compare the patch with current local/remote work before integration. The patch adds an isolated snapshot and overwrites no earlier source.
+
+## Completed construction
+
+For every integer d>=2 and 0<=h<=binom(d,2), the code constructs an original type-103 tiling of `V(d+3h,2d+3h)` with `binom(d,2)-h` right stones and `3h(h+d)` bones. The canonical q decomposition is exhausted: retained q=0, q=3k, q=3k+1,k>=4, fixed q=1,2,4,5, and the newly completed q=3k+2,k>=4 plus exceptional q=7,8,10,11. The receiving map includes d=m through the original finite-tail index inverse.
+
+## Proof
+
+The new uniform endpoint is the sum of a translated parent sequence without its last upper patch, an exact eight-bone beta-to-beta+6 bridge, and a twice-rotated parent sequence. The second deleted source stone is rho^2 of the original corner stone, not rho. All negative edit generators are distinct members of the original initial scaffold. New exact rational certificates prove source membership and all parameter ranges. Small endpoint tables supply the four exceptions for every allowed m.
+
+The positive partition follows from the exact original cell incidence identity, not from optimization feasibility. The original support-indexed augmented complexes, the supported differential square, the internal quotient/coequalizer, original killed-representative maps, full integral matching-kernel coordinates and forest duals are retained.
+
+## Provenance
+
+The owner reported Sharma's prior full-solution claim and older published bone homology. No novelty is asserted in bare existence or that algebra. This construction was completed from the existing residual-and-repair sources without importing Sharma's manuscript. It is not a proof-step audit of Sharma. The full original-P7 assembly explicitly retains the published generalized-compression residue-two input; this is not an independent reproof of that literature theorem.
+
+Read `turn10/PROVENANCE.md` and the proof's section 11. Keep external-review state `CLAIMED_UNVERIFIED` pending independent review. No new Lean build, remote merge, paid compute or automatic author contact is requested.
