+`source10.py` expresses (7) in six independent Laurent variables. Its original integer numerator vanishes identically, as detailed in Section 8. The right side is the indicator of a disjoint union by (3); every term on the left is nonnegative. Thus the identity also proves that (6) is a disjoint 27-cell set and that \(B_0+S\) is a positive packing of exactly its stated complement. Adding \(A\setminus A_0\) gives the actual initial scaffold on the full common support.
